cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Zimmerman Programme: the galactic acceleration scale from the dark-energy density (a0 = kappa c sqrt(G rho_Lambda))"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. Papers have their own DOIs (see README, Publication record)."
